%%CONSTANT%%
	000002 UniqueID         =0x4DF7
	020005 Title            ="BPW Constant for EGR Off"
	020011 DescSize         =0x17D
	020010 Desc             ="the table \"BPW Constant for EGR On\" is used any time EGR is on, and when in transition, the difference between these values are smoothed. the 5.7L uses a 61.2lb/hr injector setup and the constant is 135. the 7.4L uses a 80 lb/hr setup and the constant is 134. the 4.3 uses 45.6lb/hr injectors and the constant is 181. larger injectors on the same engine requires a smaller number."
